title: "Pi court skill: put your idea on trial in front of a jury of 12 sub-agents"
abstract: "A Pi port of the original court skill: a prosecutor sub-agent, a defense sub-agent, a jury of 12 sub-agents who vote on their own, and a judge who reads the verdict and what would flip it. Derived from the Claude Code court skill by Alex Chen."
